# Secrets and local browser state living in this folder — never commit.
# (The code here — agent.py, README.md, requirements.txt, site-notes.md — IS committed.)
.env               # your ANTHROPIC_API_KEY  (copy .env.example -> .env)
logins.json        # site usernames/passwords (copy logins.example.json -> logins.json)
profile/           # Chrome user-data dir: cookies, live login sessions
files/             # agent workspace: downloaded parts, quotes, scratch files
__pycache__/
